        {% else %}
          <span class="badge-tag badge-good">Low Leverage</span>
        {% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="guide-box">
  <div class="guide-box-header">[i] How to Read Peer Comparison Multiples</div>
  <div><span class="guide-box-sub">Beginner Reading Guide:</span> Operating Margin (OPM) shows how much profit a company retains from sales before tax and interest. Low Debt/Equity (&lt;0.3x) across these companies means they have very low debt and strong financial health.</div>
  <div><span class="guide-box-expert">Institutional / Expert Context:</span> Cross-peer operational benchmarking reveals fixed-cost absorption efficiency, wage pressure resilience, and onshore subcontractor cost mitigation across the Indian IT sector.</div>
</div>

{% else %}
<!-- Institutional Entity Card -->
<h3 style="color: #0f172a; font-size: 9.5pt; margin-top: 6pt;">{{ company.get('name', 'Tata Consultancy Services Limited') }} — Institutional Entity Card</h3>
<table class="entity-card-table">
